<h3><u>Eik Hai Naara Haidery</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Eik Hai Naara Haidery</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">Ho Eik Hai Naara Haidery<br>
Ya Ali Ya Ali Ya Ali(A.S) Haider(a.s.)</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>(Eik Hai Naara Haidery Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery) x2</p>
<ol><li>Aisa Naara Mil Kay Lagao Soi Hui Ummat Ko Jagao </li><p>Jaen Najaf Tak Is Ki Sadaen Mushkil Ko Khatir Mein Na Laao</p><p>(Jhomay Najaf Ki Har Gali) x2 Eik Hai Nara Haidery</p><p>(Eik Hai Naara Haidery Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery) x2</p><li>Yeh Naara Islami Naara Yeh Naara Hai Khair-e-Amal</li><p>Is Naaray Ki Zad Peh Rahay Hain Khyber Khandaq Jang-e-Jamal</p><p>(Akhir Duniya Maan Gai) x2 Eik Hai Naar Haidery </p><p>(Eik Hai Naara Haidery Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery) x2</p><li>Khail Kay Maidanon Say Lekar Batil Kay Aiwanon Tak</li><p>Is Naaray Ki Gonj Suni Hai Maqtal Say Zindanon Tak</p><p>(Bol Rahi Hai Har Sadi) x2 Eik Hai Naara Haidery</p><p>(Eik Hai Naara Haidery Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery) x2</p><li>Pakistani Fauj Ka Naara Allaho Ya Haidery Naara</li><p>Hanafi Naara Jaffery Naara Har Maslak Har Qaum Ka Naara</p><p>(Sab Ki Baqa Bhi Hai Yehi) x2 Eik Hai Naara Haidery</p><p>(Eik Hai Naara Haidery Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery) x2</p><li>Yeh Naara Naara Hi Nahin Hai Zarb Hai Qalb-e-Batil Par</li><p>Le Aya Tha Nooh Ki Kashti Ko Yeh Naara Sahil Par</p><p>(Jis Mein Chupi Hai Zindagi) x2 Eik Hai Naara Haidery</p><p>(Eik Hai Naara Haidery Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery) x2</p><li>Donon Jahan Mein Aey Maula Tu Hai Aur Teri Sarkaar</li><p>Tujh Ko Dia Hai Nabi(s.a.w.w.) Nay Alam Rab Nay Bhaiji Hai Talwar</p><p>(Baat Yeh Kitnon Ko Khali) x2 Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery</p><p>(Eik Hai Naara Haidery Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery) x2</p><li>Zarb-e-Ali To Zarb-e-Khuda Hai Taigh-e-Ali Bhi Taigh-e-Khuda Hai</li><p>Tum Chahay Mano Na Mano Yeh Dekho Tareekh Mein Kia Hai</p><p>(Kehtay Rahay Iqbal Bhi) x2 Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery</p><p>(Eik Hai Naara Haidery Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery) x2</p><li>Zarb-e-Ali Hai Aik Ibadat Zarb-e-Ali Maqsood-e-Risalat(s.a.w.w.)</li><p>Zarb-e-Ali Ki Zad Mein Aakar Bach Nahin Sakti Kufr Ki Quwwat</p><p>(Jaan Gaey Yeh To Sabhi) x2 Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery</p><p>(Eik Hai Naara Haidery Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery) x2</p><li>Momin Ki Naslon Ko Bachakar Batil Ko Dozakh Mein Girakar</li></ol>

<p>Do Hisson Mein Tol Kay Katay Zarb-e-Ali Nay Zulm Kay Lashkar</p>
<p>(Taigh Bhi Hai Meezan Bhi) x2 Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery</p>
<p>(Eik Hai Naara Haidery Eik Hai Zarb-e-Haidery) x2</p></font></p>
               
